The Property window allows you to change properties of the File Manager.  To change these properties, simply modify the settings then SELECT the Apply button.  If you make changes which you do not wish to apply you can Dismiss the window (using the Window Menu) or SELECT the Reset Button.  To reset the settings to the factory defaults SELECT "Reset To Factory".  If you would like the new settings to remain in effect for subsequent File Manager sessions SELECT "Set Defaults".  For detailed information on any of the options move the mouse pointer over the option and hit HELP.
